# The Linux C files compiled into the archive, relative to the Linux root, one per line.
# Under the Kbuild directories of vendor.toml the list must equal what Kbuild builds minus `cut`;
# files from elsewhere (lib/*.c) can be added below the Kbuild ones.
# Genode pc_wifi's core-kernel set (kernel, mm, lib, crypto, drivers/base, net/core) minus the files
# Genode shadows and the userspace interface. In kernel link order: initcalls run in this order.
